---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-[#080810]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="font-mono text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">// ENGINES INTEGRADOS</div>
      <h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">4 engines de software. 640+ comandos validados.</h2>
      <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] text-base max-w-2xl mb-6">Cada capacidade do AgentPuter é impulsionada por um engine de software real — controlado via CLI, não capturas de tela.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6 text-xs text-[#4B5563] font-mono">
        <span><span class="text-accent">640+</span> sequências de comandos validadas</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">4</span> engines para cenários principais</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">100%</span> processamento local</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(56,189,248,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📄</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #38BDF8;">ap-docs</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #38BDF8; background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08);">158 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">LibreOffice</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #38BDF8; opacity: 0.7;">Writer · Calc · Impress · Draw — Modo headless</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Controle headless completo da suite LibreOffice. Gere Word/Excel/PPT/PDF com macros, modelos e gráficos.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Documentos Writer</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Planilhas Calc</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Apresentações Impress</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Gráficos Draw</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Exportação PDF</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Aplicar modelo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs new --type report</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs chart --data file.csv</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs export --pdf --toc</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs macro run --name monthly</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Relatórios trimestrais</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Docs técnica</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Redigir contratos</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #38BDF8;">Ver casos de uso →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(167,139,250,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎨</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #A78BFA;">ap-design</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #A78BFA; background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08);">203 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Inkscape</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #A78BFA; opacity: 0.7;">Vetor SVG · Pôster · Ícone · Logo · Exportação pixel</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Controle preciso de nós SVG, caminhos, filtros e layout de texto via Inkscape. Exporta em qualquer resolução.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Arte vetorial SVG</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Design de pôsteres</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Geração de ícones</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Operações de caminho</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Efeitos de filtro</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Exportação em lote</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design canvas --size 1080x1920</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design text --weight bold --color white</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design export --png 2x</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design batch --variants 10</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Pôsteres marketing</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Ativos de marca</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Ícones UI</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #A78BFA;">Ver casos de uso →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(251,191,36,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📐</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #FBBF24;">ap-diagrams</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #FBBF24; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08);">138 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Draw.io (diagrams.net)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #FBBF24; opacity: 0.7;">Fluxogramas · Arquitetura · ER · Sequência · UML</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Crie diagramas técnicos profissionais via CLI do draw.io. Bibliotecas de ícones AWS/GCP/Azure integradas.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Arquitetura de microsserviços</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Topologia de rede</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Diagramas ER</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Fluxos de negócio</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Diagramas de sequência</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Diagramas UML</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams new --type microservice</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams add node --label 'API Gateway'</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams export --svg --theme dark</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams from-schema --input db.sql</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Arquitetura de sistemas</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Design BD</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Processos de negócio</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #FBBF24;">Ver casos de uso →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(74,222,128,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎵</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #4ADE80;">ap-audio</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #4ADE80; background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08);">141 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">sox + ffmpeg</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #4ADE80; opacity: 0.7;">Remoção de ruído · Edição · Conversão · Normalização de loudness</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">sox lida com efeitos e análises de áudio; ffmpeg gerencia a conversão de codec e contêiner.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Remoção inteligente de ruído</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Detecção e corte de silêncio</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Normalização EBU R128</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Conversão de formato</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Mix multipista</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Análise de áudio</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio denoise --input raw.wav</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio loudnorm --target -14 LUFS</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio convert --mp3 128k</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio trim --remove-silence</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Pós-prod podcast</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Gravação de cursos</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Áudio de reuniões</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #4ADE80;">Ver casos de uso →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#1E1E2E]">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest mb-3">// POR QUE CLI E NÃO GUI?</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 text-xs text-[#4B5563] leading-relaxed">
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">API estável</p>Interfaces CLI não quebram com atualizações de UI. Uma integração funciona a longo prazo.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">Controle preciso</p>Manipule arquivos, coordenadas e parâmetros diretamente — saída perfeita ao pixel sempre.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">Em lote</p>O mesmo comando executa 100+ tarefas simultaneamente. Automação GUI só pode clicar uma coisa por vez.</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[#2A2A3A] text-xs font-mono mt-4">// Based on CLI-Anything by HKUDS Lab (MIT License) · Extended &amp; internalized by AgentPuter</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
